---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SuperBlock from '../components/SuperBlock.astro';
---

<Layout title="UltraGeoSite" description="Hello my name is Ultrageopro I want to live in Uganda">
  <main class="mx-auto p-4 text-white leading-relaxed mt-7">
	<h1><strong class="text-gradient">UltraGeoPro</strong></h1>
    <SuperBlock>
		<span slot="header">🚀 Ok, let's get started</span>
		I am <strong class="accent-text font-bold">UltraGeoPro</strong>, a developer from 
		<span class="inline-accent">Moscow</span>. I currently work at <a href="https://tech.vk.com">VK Tech</a> as a backend developer. I also study computer science and mathematics at <span class="inline-accent">HSE AMI</span> & <span class="inline-accent">CU MCS</span>.
		I think you’ll enjoy reading various posts on this site because I put in a lot of effort.
		You can find all information about me in the 
		<a href="/about" class="accent-link">About</a> section, and my contact details in the 
		<a href="/contacts" class="accent-link">Contacts (sexual)</a> section. Also you may see my brand new logo <a href="/brand-new-logo" class="accent-link">here</a>.
		<span slot="footer-webring"><a href="https://webring.otomir23.me/19/prev">&lt; prev</a> [webring] <a href="https://webring.otomir23.me/19/next">next &gt;</a></span>
	</SuperBlock>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
	main {
	  padding: 1rem;
	  width: min(100%, 800px);
	  max-width: 100%;
	  color: white;
	  font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw + 1rem, 20px);
	  line-height: 1.6;
	  box-sizing: border-box;
	  overflow-wrap: break-word;
	}
  
	h1 {
	  font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw + 1rem, 5.5rem);
	  text-align: center;
	}

	.text-gradient {
		font-weight: bold;
		background-image: var(--accent-gradient);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-size: 400%;
		background-position: 0%;
		animation: gradient-animation 5s infinite cubic-bezier(0.55, 0.085, 0.68, 0.53);
	}

	.inline-accent {
		color: rgb(var(--accent-light));
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		main {
			padding: 0.85rem;
			font-size: 0.98rem;
			line-height: 1.5;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 10vw, 3.2rem);
			margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		}
	}

	/* Beautiful animation	 */
	@keyframes gradient-animation {
	0% {
		background-position: 0% 50%;
	}
	50% {
		background-position: 100% 50%;
	}
	100% {
		background-position: 0% 50%;
	}
	}
  </style>
